# MazeDNS blocklist template (hosts or plain-domain format).
#
# This file ships EMPTY on purpose: a fresh install blocks nothing until you opt
# in. Domains listed here are tagged with this file's name ("blocklist") as their
# category — separate from the "custom" rules you add in the UI.
#
# A blocked domain also blocks its subdomains. Add entries in either format:
#   0.0.0.0 ads.example.com        # hosts format
#   tracking.example.org           # plain domain
#
# For real coverage, point filter.blocklist_files at a maintained list such as
# StevenBlack or OISD. Example entries (commented out):
# 0.0.0.0 doubleclick.net
# 0.0.0.0 googleadservices.com
